WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.209 --> 00:00:01.042
(audience laughs)

00:00:01.042 --> 00:00:03.030
- Anyone else have one
of those nativity plays

00:00:03.030 --> 00:00:04.887
where they just let any fucker in?

00:00:04.887 --> 00:00:05.720
(audience laughs)

00:00:05.720 --> 00:00:06.930
Yeah, they're ridiculous.

00:00:06.930 --> 00:00:08.890
I stood up there on stage as the emu

00:00:08.890 --> 00:00:11.007
next to a lobster and Sonic the Hedgehog.

00:00:11.007 --> 00:00:13.670
(audience laughs)

00:00:13.670 --> 00:00:15.310
And my mom would try to
cheer me up about it.

00:00:15.310 --> 00:00:16.710
She'd be like, Jack, you never know.

00:00:16.710 --> 00:00:19.810
There may have been an emu in the manger.

00:00:19.810 --> 00:00:23.090
I'm like, Mommy, let's
look at the facts, here.

00:00:23.090 --> 00:00:26.920
Firstly, emus, native to Australia.

00:00:26.920 --> 00:00:30.600
And more importantly, they can't fly.

00:00:30.600 --> 00:00:33.420
So unless this emu was
a very strong swimmer

00:00:33.420 --> 00:00:36.393
or shagging one of the
Wise Men, I call bullshit.

00:00:36.393 --> 00:00:39.373
(audience laughs)

00:00:39.373 --> 00:00:42.537
- [Announcer] It's the world
premier of "Emu, the Musical."

00:00:44.350 --> 00:00:47.100
- [Narrator] And Mary did have a baby,

00:00:47.100 --> 00:00:49.389
and he was called Jesus.

00:00:49.389 --> 00:00:50.826
- [Crowd] Jesus.

00:00:50.826 --> 00:00:52.726
- [Narrator] And the Lord was pleased.

00:00:55.625 --> 00:00:57.988
♪ Perhaps you recognize the scene ♪

00:00:57.988 --> 00:01:00.530
♪ It's not so strange for you and me ♪

00:01:00.530 --> 00:01:03.285
♪ It looks kind of familiar ♪

00:01:03.285 --> 00:01:06.132
♪ But look again, what do you see ♪

00:01:06.132 --> 00:01:08.291
(audience cheers and applauds)

00:01:08.291 --> 00:01:11.378
♪ Forget the donkey ♪

00:01:11.378 --> 00:01:14.170
♪ Forget the sheep ♪

00:01:14.170 --> 00:01:17.183
♪ Forget Baby Jesus ♪

00:01:17.183 --> 00:01:20.163
♪ It's all about me ♪

00:01:20.163 --> 00:01:22.918
♪ The emu ♪

00:01:22.918 --> 00:01:26.587
♪ The emu ♪

00:01:26.587 --> 00:01:29.678
♪ The nativity that we were taught ♪

00:01:29.678 --> 00:01:32.087
♪ Turns out not to be entirely true ♪

00:01:32.087 --> 00:01:32.920
- Rude.
- Rude.

00:01:32.920 --> 00:01:35.709
♪ Here's the Christmas
story you've never heard ♪

00:01:35.709 --> 00:01:40.709
♪ The central character's
a flightless bird ♪

00:01:40.847 --> 00:01:43.603
♪ I was an emu, a weakling born ♪

00:01:43.603 --> 00:01:46.639
♪ To my father, the classic fool ♪

00:01:46.639 --> 00:01:49.620
♪ Didn't recognize my worth ♪

00:01:49.620 --> 00:01:53.962
♪ Sent me away to boarding school ♪

00:01:53.962 --> 00:01:55.909
♪ Cue tiny violins ♪

00:01:55.909 --> 00:02:00.150
♪ All alone in my dormitory ♪

00:02:00.150 --> 00:02:04.423
♪ The other emus all ignored me ♪

00:02:04.423 --> 00:02:08.905
♪ Sat alone watching the clock ♪

00:02:08.905 --> 00:02:13.184
♪ Me and my tuck box
and our crunchy sock ♪

00:02:13.184 --> 00:02:16.101
(audience laughs)

